{"product_id":"whose-feet-step-into-reading","title":"Whose Feet? (Step into Reading)","description":"\u003cp\u003eDo you like guessing games? These easy-to-read riddle rhymes feature mole feet, duck feet, orangutan feet...and more! Who knew that feet could be so special and perform such extraordinary...feats!Step 1 Readers feature big type and easy words. Rhymes and rhythmic text paired with picture clues help children decode the words--for children who know the alphabet and are eager to begin reading.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 152 x 229\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Nina Hess\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780375826238\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 32\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45738272096409,"sku":"5RD9780375826238","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68d0dc4d48178_Whose_Feet___Step_into_Reading__Nina_Hess.jpg?v=1758560246","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/whose-feet-step-into-reading","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}